# Verification Scripts

## Pre-Deployment Checklist

```bash
# 1. Check Node version
node --version  # Should be 18+

# 2. Install dependencies
npm install
cd server && npm install && cd ..

# 3. Check environment variables
echo $SUPABASE_URL
echo $PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID
echo $LLM_API_KEY

# 4. Test build
npm run build
cd server && npm run build && cd ..

# 5. Test server locally
cd server
npm run dev
# Should show: "🚀 LocalRank AI Server running on port 3001"

# 6. Test frontend locally
cd ..
npm run dev
# Should show: "VITE ready"

# 7. Verify Supabase connection
# Sign up in UI and check Supabase Auth > Users

# 8. Verify PayPal connection
# Try upgrading and confirm PayPal redirect

# 9. Check GitHub Actions
# Visit repo Action tab
```

## Deployment Verification

```bash
# 1. Check Vercel deployments
vercel ls

# 2. Check frontend is live
curl https://your-frontend.vercel.app/

# 3. Check backend is live
curl https://your-backend.vercel.app/api/health

# 4. Check Supabase
# Table Editor > payments and profiles

# 5. Check PayPal webhook
# Developer Dashboard > Webhooks
```

